  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "[0.3.0] - 2026-11-22\n\nReleased with the suite at 0.3.0. Requires DotnetCronner >= 0.3.0. No data-format change.\n\nChanged\n- UseRedisAsStore(...) registers the store through the new public ICronnerBuilder.UseStore(factory, …)\n  instead of the builder's store holder, which DotnetCronner 0.3.0 removed. Behavior is unchanged, but\n  the two packages must be upgraded together: this version does not load against DotnetCronner 0.2.x,\n  and 0.2.x of this package does not load against DotnetCronner 0.3.0.\n\nAdded\n- The store is covered by the shared data-contract and scheduler-scenario suites in addition to the lock\n  contract (run against a real Redis on every CI build).\n- The public API of the package is tracked in PublicAPI.Shipped.txt / PublicAPI.Unshipped.txt.",
